	<section_number>1-237</section_number>
	<catch_line>Process</catch_line>
	<text>
		"Process" includes subpoenas, the summons and complaint in a civil action, and process in statutory actions.
	</text>
	<history>1954, c. 543, § 1-13.23:1; 1986, c. 155; 2005, cc. 681, 839.</history>
